geSectionCanonId":"51295b83-cab6-410c-a2b5-47b7268183eb","name":"协同设计","position":1,"pageId":"6d66b113-1565-4492-8780-8dcb4c1c6a48","pageCanonId":"3b4b956e-da36-419d-bf59-c1c0455601af","isVisible":true,"contentBlocks":[{"pageContentBlockId":"4d1d2b8b-6ab1-455a-9ab8-453fec460f6b","pageContentBlockCanonId":"02a33854-898a-4a39-ab77-0196fada3d23","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"208557a3-173d-45aa-97d2-6ec5b1ced795","pageSectionCanonId":"51295b83-cab6-410c-a2b5-47b7268183eb","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"e7b5cfa4-8ebf-4421-aabe-fc8dd22c09e3","pageContentChunkCanonId":"9d4628ab-7ded-41a7-a760-1ddefbdfc833","htmlValue":"<p>共同设计通过让产品或服务的使用者参与创建过程来支持创新，并超越了传统的用户研究。请优先与背景和经历多元的人接触，并记住与所有人共同构建是一个持续的过程。通过积极接触那些常被忽视的社区，你可以构建对所有人更有益的产品。通过对广泛人群开展市场调研，验证你的假设并发现新的机会。</p>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-02-16T09:43:29.541Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"43238a07-f3c0-4aa7-9e6a-6facd3add4f8","pageContentBlockCanonId":"92f49a58-4c3b-4937-92f9-3455267c202a","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"208557a3-173d-45aa-97d2-6ec5b1ced795","pageSectionCanonId":"51295b83-cab6-410c-a2b5-47b7268183eb","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"4518274a-103a-4860-93a9-18c4519ed763","pageContentChunkCanonId":"378adafa-b7ae-4264-bb3c-5d5103c3b0ae","htmlValue":"","footer":"","imageUrl":"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/design-spec/o/projects%2Fgoogle-material-3%2Fimages%2Fmlav38v4-1.png?alt=media&token=3739b0eb-c02a-446e-aae5-bbf18c36213e","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":600,"imageWidth":2048,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"IMAGE","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":null,"showBorderAroundMedia":null,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-02-16T09:44:10.749Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"6d3d94bb-7c47-4328-88eb-3f925256ee03","pageContentBlockCanonId":"461720d4-a96f-4086-a8a1-13ef5a51916b","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":true,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"208557a3-173d-45aa-97d2-6ec5b1ced795","pageSectionCanonId":"51295b83-cab6-410c-a2b5-47b7268183eb","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"02d520a7-17ff-491f-80a0-2587839bd30a","pageContentChunkCanonId":"e29aa2d7-f422-4205-8000-144d77edcd03","htmlValue":"<h2>需要思考的问题</h2>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-02-16T09:44:50.041Z"}]},{"pageContentBlockId":"deb32d49-0d3c-4717-b4ad-dad5c1839fc6","pageContentBlockCanonId":"e871bac6-3624-43b6-8bab-e4767037ac54","isHidden":false,"isSqueezed":false,"title":null,"pageSectionId":"208557a3-173d-45aa-97d2-6ec5b1ced795","pageSectionCanonId":"51295b83-cab6-410c-a2b5-47b7268183eb","contentChunks":[{"pageContentChunkId":"a2e5750f-31fe-49d9-9f4f-cc982e56409e","pageContentChunkCanonId":"10a4923e-3b8d-461c-997d-7e065de6d99d","htmlValue":"<ul><li id=\"isPasted\">在牢记人们的属性及其所处环境的前提下，有哪些满足用户需求的机会？ <ul><li>还有谁能从产品中受益？ </li><li>他们的需求是什么？ </li><li>你如何确保被忽视的社区被纳入持续进行的测试？ </li></ul></li><li>在整个开发过程中，你如何尽早且频繁地让社区成员和专家参与？ <ul><li>他们的反馈将如何影响关于功能优先级、功能和信息传达的关键决策？ </li><li>当你从构思阶段进入产品开发的其他阶段时，如何继续应用这些洞察？ </li><li>有哪些机会可以获得更多洞察？ </li></ul></li><li>如果将来自被忽视社区的人排除在外，会有哪些风险和潜在危害？ <ul><li>你该如何应对？ </li></ul></li><li>如果你的工具使用 ML 或 AI，你可以做些什么来降低偏见风险？这份<a href=\"https://design.google/library/people-ai-research\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">资源合集</a>可以提供帮助。</li></ul>","footer":null,"imageUrl":"","imageUrlFife":null,"imageHeight":null,"imageWidth":null,"altText":"","videoUrl":null,"videoHeight":null,"videoWidth":null,"codeUrl":null,"prototypeUrl":null,"resourceName":null,"libraryModuleType":null,"moduleConfigurationOverrides":null,"contentChunkType":"TEXT","crbHeight":500,"linkUrl":null,"openLinkUrlInNewWindow":true,"showBorderAroundMedia":false,"useSolidBackgroundOnMedia":true,"isControl":false,"captionModifier":null,"captionModifierCustomName":null,"flex":1,"autoplayVideo":null,"snippetCode":null,"snippetLanguage":null,"snippetLineNumbers":true,"updatedTimestamp":"2026-02-16T09:45:31.358Z"}]}]}]}